<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:'Aptos Display',sans-serif;">We have, in the past 12 months disclosed the following categories of personal information and sensitive personal information (denoted by *) about users for the purposes set out above in&nbsp;"How we Collect and Use your Personal Information"&nbsp;and&nbsp;"How we Disclose Personal Information":</span></p>
