      <h1>Refund policy</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="shopify-policy__body">
      <div class="rte">
        <p>At Oak &amp; Lily, we believe you'll love our products! However, if you change your mind, we're here to help.</p>
<p><strong>Return Eligibility:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>We offer a <strong>5-day return policy</strong>. Please ensure your return request is submitted within 5 days of receiving your item(s).</li>
<li>The product must be in <strong>unused condition</strong>, with all original tags and packaging intact.</li>
<li>A <strong>receipt or proof of purchase</strong> is required for all returns.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Conditions for Return:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Returns cannot be processed for <strong>incorrect or incomplete shipping addresses</strong>, failed delivery attempts, or <strong>refusal of the package</strong>.</li>
<li>We cannot accept <strong>emails or images</strong> regarding returns if they are sent more than 48 hours after delivery.</li>
<li>Returns are not eligible for products purchased during <strong>special sales promotions</strong> or for <strong>freebie items</strong>.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>How to Initiate a Return:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Email us at <strong><a rel="noopener">help@avarah.in</a></strong> or send a WhatsApp message to <strong>+91 8088 743 076</strong> with your <strong>order ID</strong> and <strong>registered email/phone number</strong>.</li>
<li>Returns will be picked up free of charge.</li>
<li>Refunds will be processed within <strong>48 hours for prepaid orders</strong> or within <strong>7 days for COD orders</strong> after the product is received at our facility.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Exchanges:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Delivery charges for exchanged products will apply according to our <strong>standard shipping policy</strong>.</li>
<li>If you're returning part of an order, please hand over only the <strong>partial order</strong> to the pickup agent.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Non-Returnable Items:</strong><br>For <strong>hygiene reasons</strong>, we cannot accept returns or provide refunds for <strong>Napkins</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>Order Cancellation Policy:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Order cancellation requests must be made <strong>before dispatch</strong>.</li>
<li>If the order has already been dispatched, we will deduct the <strong>shipping charges</strong> from the refund.</li>
</ul>
<p>We appreciate your understanding!</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
